---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { upcomingVisit } from "../data/upcoming";
---

<BaseLayout
	title="Dharma Activity — Padma Pura Foundation"
	description="Dharma activities connected with Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche and Padma Pura Foundation in the Netherlands."
>
	<section class="activities-opening" aria-labelledby="activities-heading">
		<p class="activities-opening__label">Activities</p>
		<h1 id="activities-heading">Dharma Activity</h1>
		<div class="activities-opening__intro">
			<p>Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche’s Dharma activity in the Netherlands includes teachings, empowerments, oral transmissions, practice guidance and opportunities to practise together.</p>
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation supports these activities and helps create the conditions for students to receive Rinpoche’s teachings and practise under his guidance.</p>
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="upcoming" aria-labelledby="upcoming-heading">
		<div class="upcoming__heading">
			<h2 id="upcoming-heading">Upcoming</h2>
			<p class="upcoming__intro">Information about Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche’s annual visit to the Netherlands.</p>
		</div>
		<ul class="upcoming__list">
			<li class="upcoming__item">
				<div class="upcoming__name">
					<span class="upcoming__title">{upcomingVisit.title}</span>
					<span class="upcoming__subtitle">{upcomingVisit.attribution}</span>
				</div>
				<div class="upcoming__status">
					<span>{upcomingVisit.expectedPeriod}</span>
					<span>{upcomingVisit.status}</span>
				</div>
				<p class="upcoming__description" set:html={upcomingVisit.seriesNote.replace(upcomingVisit.title, `<em>${upcomingVisit.title}</em>`)}></p>
				<p class="upcoming__closing">{upcomingVisit.detailsStatus}</p>
			</li>
		</ul>
	</section>

	<section class="visits" aria-labelledby="visits-heading">
		<h2 id="visits-heading">Rinpoche in the Netherlands</h2>
		<div class="visits__prose">
			<p>Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche visits the Netherlands annually to give teachings, empowerments, oral transmissions and practice guidance, and to meet with students.</p>
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation supports the organisation of these annual visits and the Dharma activities that take place during them. Confirmed dates and practical information are published in Upcoming.</p>
		</div>
		<figure class="visits__image">
			<img src="/images/activities/rinpoche-with-students.jpg" alt="Tenzin Samphel Rinpoche in conversation with students" />
		</figure>
	</section>

	<section class="tsog" aria-labelledby="tsog-heading">
		<h2 id="tsog-heading">Tsog practice</h2>
		<div class="tsog__prose">
			<p>Tsog is a Vajrayana group practice in which practitioners come together for practice and offerings.</p>
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation usually organises Tsog practice online via Microsoft Teams, around Guru Rinpoche Day and Dakini Day when circumstances allow.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="tsog__participation">
			<p>If you would like to take part, please email <a href="mailto:info@padmapura.com">info@padmapura.com</a>. We will add you to the Tsog mailing list, through which invitations and practical information for upcoming Tsog practices are shared.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="tsog__images">
			<img src="/images/activities/guru-tsokye-tuktik.jpg" alt="Guru Tsokye Tuktik thangka" />
			<img src="/images/activities/khandro-tuktik.jpg" alt="Khandro Tuktik thangka" />
		</div>
	</section>

	<section class="tsetar" aria-labelledby="tsetar-heading">
		<h2 id="tsetar-heading">Tsetar</h2>
		<div class="tsetar__prose">
			<p>Tsetar is the Buddhist practice of saving animals from situations in which they would otherwise be killed and releasing them into conditions where they can continue their lives.</p>
			<p>Padma Pura Foundation supports Tsetar activities under Rinpoche’s guidance. Because each activity requires careful preparation, information is shared only when and where appropriate.</p>
		</div>
		<figure class="tsetar__image">
			<img src="/images/activities/tsetar.png" alt="Tsetar activity" />
		</figure>
	</section>

	<section class="gutor" aria-labelledby="gutor-heading">
		<h2 id="gutor-heading">Gutor</h2>
		<div class="gutor__prose">
			<p>Gutor is a Vajrayana practice traditionally held before Losar, the Tibetan New Year. It is a practice of purification and the clearing of obstacles, helping create auspicious conditions for the year ahead.</p>
		</div>
		<figure class="gutor__image">
			<img src="/images/activities/gutor.png" alt="Gutor practice" />
		</figure>
	</section>

	<section class="activities-closing" aria-labelledby="activities-closing-heading">
		<h2 id="activities-closing-heading">General mailing list</h2>
		<p>Important updates and information about Rinpoche’s activities are shared through the general mailing list, together with information about other Padma Pura Foundation activities, including Tsetar and Gutor. To join the general mailing list, please email <a href="mailto:info@padmapura.com">info@padmapura.com</a>.</p>
	</section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
	.activities-opening {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-block: clamp(var(--space-8), 9vw, 9rem) clamp(var(--space-7), 8vw, 8rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.activities-opening__label {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0.02em;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.activities-opening h1 {
		max-width: 14ch;
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 6.5vw, 6rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		line-height: 0.98;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.activities-opening__intro {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 5vw, var(--space-8));
		max-width: var(--content-width);
		margin-top: clamp(var(--space-7), 5.8vw, 5.5rem);
	}

	.activities-opening__intro p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.upcoming {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-8), 8vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.upcoming__heading {
		width: min(100%, var(--content-width-narrow));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-6), 5vw, var(--space-8));
	}

	.upcoming h2 {
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-4);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.upcoming__intro {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.5;
	}

	.upcoming__list {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.upcoming__item {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(12rem, 0.45fr);
		gap: var(--space-5);
		align-items: baseline;
		padding-block: var(--space-5);
		border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.upcoming__name {
		color: inherit;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-weight: 450;
		line-height: 1.25;
	}

	.upcoming__title,
	.upcoming__subtitle,
	.upcoming__closing {
		display: block;
	}

	.upcoming__title {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 380;
		line-height: 1.15;
	}

	.upcoming__subtitle {
		display: block;
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
	}

	.upcoming__status {
		color: var(--color-muted);
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.upcoming__status span {
		display: block;
	}

	.upcoming__status span + span {
		margin-top: var(--space-3);
		font-size: var(--text-sm);
	}

	.upcoming__description,
	.upcoming__closing {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin: var(--space-6) 0 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.upcoming__closing {
		margin-top: var(--space-4);
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.upcoming__empty {
		margin: 0;
		padding-block: var(--space-5);
		border-block: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		color: var(--color-muted);
	}

	.visits {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 8vw, 8rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.visits h2 {
		max-width: 18ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 3.5vw, 3rem);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.1;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.visits__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.visits__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.visits__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.visits__image {
		width: 70%;
		margin: calc(var(--space-8) * 0.75) 0 0;
	}

	.visits__image img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.tsog {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 8vw, 8rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.tsog h2 {
		max-width: 16ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 4vw, 3.25rem);
		font-weight: 380;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.tsog__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.tsog__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.tsog__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.tsog__participation {
		max-width: 42rem;
		margin-top: var(--space-7);
		padding-top: var(--space-6);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
	}

	.tsog__participation p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.tsog__images {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		align-items: flex-start;
		gap: var(--space-5);
		width: 68%;
		margin-top: var(--space-8);
	}

	.tsog__images img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.tsetar {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7.5vw, 7.5rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.tsetar h2 {
		max-width: 16ch;
		margin: 0 0 var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 3.75vw, 3rem);
		font-weight: 370;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.tsetar__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.tsetar__prose p {
		margin: 0;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.tsetar__prose p + p {
		margin-top: var(--space-6);
	}

	.tsetar__image {
		width: 48%;
		margin: calc(var(--space-8) * 0.75) 0 0;
	}

	.tsetar__image img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.gutor {
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.gutor h2,
	.gutor p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.gutor h2 {
		margin-bottom: var(--space-7);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-xl);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.gutor__prose {
		max-width: 42rem;
	}

	.gutor__image {
		grid-column: 1 / -1;
		width: min(48%, 34.56rem);
		margin: var(--space-7) 0 0;
	}

	.gutor__image img {
		display: block;
		width: 100%;
		height: auto;
	}

	.gutor p {
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	.activities-closing {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 0.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
		gap: clamp(var(--space-6), 6vw, var(--space-8));
		width: min(100% - (var(--space-6) * 2), var(--content-width));
		padding-top: var(--space-6);
		padding-bottom: clamp(var(--space-7), 7vw, 7rem);
		border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
		margin-inline: auto;
	}

	.activities-closing h2,
	.activities-closing p {
		margin: 0;
	}

	.activities-closing h2 {
		padding-top: var(--space-2);
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-size: var(--text-lg);
		font-weight: 360;
		line-height: 1.05;
		font-optical-sizing: auto;
	}

	.activities-closing p {
		max-width: 34rem;
		font-family: var(--font-sans);
		font-size: var(--text-base);
		font-weight: 400;
		line-height: 1.6;
	}

	@media (max-width: 48rem) {
		.activities-opening {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-block: var(--space-8) var(--space-9);
		}

		.activities-opening h1 {
			max-width: none;
			font-size: clamp(2.75rem, 12vw, 4rem);
			line-height: 1.02;
		}

		.activities-opening__intro {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: var(--space-6);
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.activities-opening__intro p {
			font-size: var(--text-base);
		}

		.upcoming {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.upcoming__heading {
			width: 100%;
		}

		.upcoming__item {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: var(--space-2);
			padding-block: var(--space-5);
		}

		.visits {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.visits h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin-bottom: var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
		}

		.visits__prose {
			max-width: none;
			margin-top: 0;
		}

		.visits__image {
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.tsog {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.tsog h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
		}

		.tsog__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.tsog__participation {
			max-width: none;
			margin-top: var(--space-6);
			padding-top: var(--space-5);
		}

		.tsog__images {
			grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr);
			gap: var(--space-7);
			width: 82%;
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.tsog__images img {
			width: 100%;
		}

		.tsetar {
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.tsetar h2 {
			max-width: none;
			margin: 0 0 var(--space-6);
			font-size: clamp(2rem, 8vw, 2.5rem);
		}

		.tsetar__prose {
			max-width: none;
			margin-left: 0;
		}

		.tsetar__image {
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.gutor {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-bottom: var(--space-9);
		}

		.gutor h2 {
			margin: 0;
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.gutor__prose {
			max-width: none;
		}

		.gutor__image {
			width: 100%;
			margin-top: var(--space-7);
		}

		.activities-closing {
			display: block;
			width: calc(100% - (var(--space-5) * 2));
			padding-top: var(--space-6);
			padding-bottom: var(--space-7);
		}

		.activities-closing h2 {
			padding: 0 0 var(--space-6);
		}

		.activities-closing p {
			max-width: none;
		}
	}
</style>
